# {{app_name}}

Lazuli app scaffolded with `lazuli new`.

## Getting started

```bash
lazuli doctor .
lazuli generate go --out dist/go
go work sync
go run ./dist/go
```

## Development loop

```bash
lazuli dev .
```

Watches `.lzi` and `lazurite.toml` for changes; regenerates `dist/` and restarts the server.

## Layout

- `app.lzi` - app-wide config (envs, urls).
- `features/` - domain features. Each is a Lazuli capability bundle.
- `lazurite.toml` - workspace manifest (Lazuli framework pin, plugins, codegen settings).
- `dist/` - generated code (regen-only; do not edit).
